      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can use my world as another data point. Using Camera.Render in PostLateUpdate. https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_544e7879-d870-42a2-9c7a-99eb95a8e62f\n\nStation animations also appear to break and revert to a prone pose. This is another purely visual issue; when viewing the player normally, this isn't the case, its only when viewed through a camera using Camera.Render in PostLateUpdate. (You can pull out a camera and view yourself and station animations work fine.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
